IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TOKEN-TREE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DRAFT-NODES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TREE-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BRANCH-FACTOR       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 VERIFIED-NODES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-TOKEN-TREE.
    IF TREE-DEPTH == 0 OR BRANCH-FACTOR == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE BRANCH-FACTOR TO VERIFIED-NODES.
    MULTIPLY TREE-DEPTH BY VERIFIED-NODES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 VERIFIED-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 BRANCH-FACTOR.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
